 <entry>
   <title>Google Mobile Ads GetClientFactory exception</title>
   <link href="//google-mobile-ads-getcientfactory-exception/"/>
   <updated>2025-09-08T00:00:00-03:00</updated>
   <id>//google-mobile-ads-getcientfactory-exception</id>
   <content type="html">
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-problem&quot;&gt;The problem&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/problem-128-32225c491.webp 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/problem-128-32225c491.png 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;img class=&quot;icon&quot; src=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/problem-128-32225c491.png&quot; alt=&quot;post image&quot; width=&quot;128&quot; height=&quot;128&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you’re experiencing this error when trying to initialize Google Mobile Ads Unity Plugin on an Android device:
&lt;script src=&quot;https://gist.github.com/5a0d001b36432bf7807f08d8f525f1d7.js?file=problem.sh&quot;&gt; &lt;/script&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is quite possible that you are facing problems with the linker.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&quot;solution&quot;&gt;Solution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/solution-128-32225c491.webp 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/solution-128-32225c491.png 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;img class=&quot;icon&quot; src=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/solution-128-32225c491.png&quot; alt=&quot;post image&quot; width=&quot;128&quot; height=&quot;128&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Open your &lt;code class=&quot;language-plaintext highlighter-rouge&quot;&gt;Assets/link.xml&lt;/code&gt; file and add the lines below:
&lt;script src=&quot;https://gist.github.com/5a0d001b36432bf7807f08d8f525f1d7.js?file=solution.xml&quot;&gt; &lt;/script&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&quot;conclusion&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/conclusion-128-32225c491.webp 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;source sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 80vw, 800px&quot; srcset=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/conclusion-128-32225c491.png 128w&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;img class=&quot;icon&quot; src=&quot;/assets/images/generated/assets/logos/conclusion-128-32225c491.png&quot; alt=&quot;post image&quot; width=&quot;128&quot; height=&quot;128&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are probably other causes for this error, but in my case, when using Unity 6000.0.23f1 with &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.google.com/admob/unity/quick-start&quot;&gt;Google Mobile Ads Unity Plugin&lt;/a&gt; 10.4.2, this was the solution.&lt;/p&gt;
